        "content": "\n**Missing integration scenarios:**\n\n1. **Chat + Socket + Action Cards** — End-to-end message flow\n   - Send message → Socket receives state_push → Chat displays response → Action card created\n\n2. **CSRF + Socket Authentication** — Token flow\n   - CSRF token fetch → Cookie set → Socket auth callback → Connection established\n\n3. **Queue Processing Under Load** — Rapid message sending\n   - Multiple messages sent while processing → Queue builds → Processes in order\n\n4. **Snapshot Deduplication** — Multiple state pushes\n   - Same log arrives twice → Only one message/card created\n\n5. **Error Recovery** — Network failures\n   - Socket disconnect → Auto-reconnect → State resync\n\n**Integration Test Skeleton:**\n```typescript\n// __tests__/integration/chat-flow.test.tsx\ndescribe('Chat Flow Integration', () => {\n  it('should handle complete message cycle', async () => {\n    // 1. Render app\n    // 2. Wait for socket connection\n    // 3. Send message\n    // 4. Mock state_push with response log\n    // 5. Verify message appears in chat\n    // 6. Verify action card created if tool log present\n  });\n});\n```\n\n---\n\n",
